    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that \"connection\" part feels like a lie. everything is just performative. i'm just so tired of the constant effort it takes to even exist in a world that wasn't built for me. it feels like there's no real version of me that actually makes sense to anyone else. it's just... heavy.",
